OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fshowers continuing overnight, mainly
OL,7,Ftowards the north coast, otherwise a
OL,8,Fdry night with clear spells. Remaining
OL,9,Frather breezy despite winds easing,
OL,10,Fhelping to keep temperatures generally
OL,11,Fup, but cooler in the countryside.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA dry and bright start, but
OL,14,Fturning cloudier into the afternoon
OL,15,Fwith the odd spot of rain, but most
OL,16,Fplaces staying dry. Remaining rather
OL,17,Fbreezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
